+            f"wlc_key_rate called on partial-coverage protocol "
+            f"{protocol.name!r}; result requires the caveat in "
+            f"docs/framework_coverage.md §3.1: {protocol.scope_reason}",
+            UserWarning,
+            stacklevel=2,
+        )
+    # ... SDP ...
+```
